        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807440/extras/fa9b9f0dec5241abfb273a1f8076cc23.avif?t=1768157470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807440/extras_big/fa9b9f0dec5241abfb273a1f8076cc23.avif?t=1768157470 width=1560 height=228 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're tired. You're hungry. You miss your pet fish. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pet fish is gone. The tank is empty. The house feels heavier than ever. You’re not okay, but you don’t tell anyone.  Through small, ordinary choices like whether to call your mom or eat another pack of instant noodles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into the quiet life of a college student struggling with loneliness and burnout until you meet your belove seafood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807440/extras/41dfce2580ad2fb254afc158d5d05353.avif?t=1768157470\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807440/extras_big/41dfce2580ad2fb254afc158d5d05353.avif?t=1768157470 width=1560 height=228 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date with your Seafood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Endings for each route</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini games </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cooking game??</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807440/extras/705c13cae4fd693